{
  "_comment": "Detects which country a headline is about. Each country has a regex (case-insensitive; (?-i:...) marks case-sensitive parts such as acronyms). Headlines naming no country fall into 'Not specified'. Region-wide words (Europe, Africa, GCC, APAC...) are listed as pseudo-countries so they still count for their region.",
